<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">01082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Talks on remaking Venezuela's political system open in Caracas without María Corina Machado, the opposition figure with the largest demonstrated following in the country.</s> <s>The United States chose a delegation led by Dinorah Figuera, who heads the twenty-fifteen assembly bloc Washington still recognizes as the last freely elected legislature.</s> <s>A pacted transition works only when each side can deliver its own people... and the party with the base is outside the room.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Explosions in southern Lebanon registered a magnitude of three point eight on regional seismic networks — the scale of a small earthquake, recorded during a ceasefire.</s> <s>Ground-motion data gives an independent measure of blast yield that neither Israel nor Lebanon controls, the same instrument that sized the Beirut port explosion within hours in twenty-twenty.</s> <s>President Joseph Aoun is now seeking Turkish backing for the American-brokered arrangement, which suggests he doesn't expect the current guarantors to enforce it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Volodymyr Zelenskyy has asked Donald Trump to secure Elon Musk's permission for Starlink to guide Ukrainian strikes inside Russia.</s> <s>Read that chain of authority again — a head of state asking another head of state to intercede with a businessman about his own country's war, because no other satellite constellation has the terminals, coverage or bandwidth to replace it.</s> <s>Every state now building sovereign digital infrastructure, from the Gulf to Nigeria to Pakistan, is watching what a capability you cannot replace looks like when it's finally tested.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Italy has reimposed border checks against Spain — not against migrants, but against a fellow member of the Schengen area.</s> <s>Giorgia Meloni invoked national security after some sixty thousand people crossed from Morocco into the Spanish enclave of Ceuta, where forty-one died at the barrier and Spanish authorities have recovered fifty-seven bodies in all.</s> <s>The people concerned are overwhelmingly West and Central African Muslims, and the machinery they've set in motion is entirely European, an argument between interior ministries in which they appear only as an input.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iran and Pakistan are returning Afghans faster than any funded plan exists to absorb them, pushing millions back into an economy that's still shrinking.</s> <s>The word used is repatriation, but non-refoulement binds both states under customary international law regardless of what the process is called.</s> <s>Kabul has neither the housing, the jobs nor the water for the people already there, so the arrivals are landing on a system that had nothing spare.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Members of the United States Congress are weighing a terrorism designation for Sudan's Rapid Support Forces, more than a year after Washington's own genocide finding in January twenty-twenty-five carried no consequences at all.</s> <s>Designation would attach sanctions and criminal liability where the finding attached only language.</s> <s>The analyst Jason Blazakis argues the real test is enforcement against the gold flows moving through the United Arab Emirates — which is precisely the part nobody has wanted to touch.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A man on death row in Abeokuta, Nigeria, has been live-streaming from a maximum-security cell for months.</s> <s>He says warders smuggle the phones in, other warders seize and ransom them back, and the same channel carries drugs, which describes not a lapse but a working internal market in access.</s> <s>The same market that lets a convicted murderer broadcast is the one that leaves a poor remand prisoner without a lawyer or a bail hearing for years.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Delhi's new cash transfer for women, worth two thousand five hundred rupees a month, will require every applicant to produce a signed letter from her elected legislator.</s> <s>There are no published criteria for that signature, no obligation to give it and no appeal against refusal, which converts an entitlement into a favour — and rebuilds exactly the clientelist channel that a decade of direct benefit transfers was designed to remove.</s> <s>Payments are meant to begin by Raksha Bandhan, in sha'Allah, in constituencies the gatekeepers themselves contest.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The commander of the European Union's Aspides escort mission says Houthi attacks now target Saudi Arabia's own tankers, and escort requests have jumped thirty-nine percent since February.</s> <s>That's a real shift — the earlier campaign aimed at vessels linked to Israel, and this one amounts to a blockade of the kingdom's shipping through Bab el-Mandeb.</s> <s>Convoy capacity is finite, and an unescorted ship's alternative is the long, costly passage round the Cape of Good Hope.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Egypt's universal health insurance scheme has finished its first phase, and the outlet Mada Masr finds patients in Port Said going six months without asthma medication.</s> <s>What makes this an indictment rather than a teething problem is that the scheme's own architects raised these objections during drafting, nearly a decade before rollout — a contributory system collects premiums in pounds while the drugs and equipment it buys are priced in dollars, and the currency has fallen repeatedly since the law passed.</s> <s>Cairo is expanding next into Minya, one of the poorest governorates in the country.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Tether's excess reserves have halved, falling to four point one one billion dollars from eight point two three billion, even as the issuer booked one and a half billion in profit for the quarter.</s> <s>The cushion shrank because the company shifted further into gold and roughly ninety-nine thousand bitcoin, and what documents this is an attestation by the firm <sub alias="B D O">BDO</sub>, not an audit.</s> <s>That distinction matters to more than traders, because Tether's dollar token circulates as the working currency for ordinary savers across Turkey, Nigeria and Pakistan.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan cut petrol and diesel prices again this week, bringing diesel down from five hundred and twenty rupees a litre in April to three hundred and ninety-two.</s> <s>Prices had spiked when the war between the United States and Iran began in February, and the regulator now resets them daily rather than weekly.</s> <s>Dealers are weighing a protest over the new schedule, which shifts the cost of daily volatility onto them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study spanning forty-two countries and the years two thousand five to twenty twenty-three finds foreign direct investment raises greenhouse emissions in the countries receiving it — and that environmental regulation significantly blunts the effect, most strongly in West and East Africa.</s> <s>The honest caveat is in the method: the researchers' proxy measures stated policy rather than enforcement, and the manuscript hasn't been edited yet.</s> <s>Still, it reframes the bargain, because capital arriving with conditions attached appears to pollute less than capital arriving with none.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's government has told the Rajya Sabha that crop-residue burning accounts for at most twenty-three percent of Delhi's winter smog, with secondary particulates and traffic ranking higher.</s> <s>Farm fires have already fallen by more than half in two years while the smog persists, which is the clearest possible evidence that the attribution was too narrow.</s> <s>Attribution decides who gets regulated — and for a decade it pointed away from the city and toward its poorest actors.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Wildfires have displaced more than three hundred and thirty thousand people across Europe this season, and France has set a modern record for burned area.</s> <s>A chart claiming Europe's quietest fire year on record went viral using real numbers read wrongly — it folded in all of Russia and shrinking cropland fires, and compared a partial season against completed ones.</s> <s>A heatwave is approaching, and the same trick of cumulative series and chosen baselines misreports inflation, migration and case counts too.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Spain is offering one billion euros to bring the Thirty Meter Telescope to La Palma instead of Mauna Kea, where Native Hawaiian protest and litigation have blocked construction since twenty-fourteen.</s> <s>It's a rare case of an indigenous movement holding a site against one of the largest instruments astronomy has ever proposed — and winning, so far, simply by not conceding.</s> <s>The American National Science Foundation still favours a rival telescope, so the money may not settle it.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>YouTube has terminated the channels of long-established creators of <sub alias="A S M R">ASMR</sub> videos, citing its nudity policy against videos containing no nudity.</s> <s>The company then said the channels linked to outside content that broke the rules, and the sanction was termination rather than removal — an entire archive and livelihood, judged on an inferred effect on the viewer that no policy text defines.</s> <s>The same undefined, unappealable standard is what strips Palestinian, Sudanese and Kashmiri documentation from these platforms as graphic content.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The American cyber agency <sub alias="SISA">CISA</sub> says more than thirty water facilities have been attacked, some traced to Iran, and has told utilities to pull their programmable logic controllers off the public internet immediately.</s> <s>That instruction is itself the admission — the equipment controlling drinking water was reachable from anywhere, with no authentication at all.</s> <s>Donald Trump called the affected Minnesota utility grossly incompetent, which leaves unasked why a small municipal water authority was expected to defend itself against a state.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google will block unverified Android apps worldwide from the thirtieth of September, with exemptions for Iran, Cuba, North Korea and occupied Ukraine — because developers under sanctions can't complete verification at all.</s> <s>Those are the places where virtual private networks, secure messengers and opposition media are built and distributed outside any store.</s> <s>So a global identity requirement arrives with a carve-out that quietly concedes the point: verification and anonymity can't both be had.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Cheap streaming sticks are shipping backdoored, before their owner downloads anything, and a home connection is what's being sold.</s> <s>Ad-fraud operators get blocked when they work from data centres, so they rent ordinary residential addresses to look legitimate — the security firm Bitsight traced this scheme to a company in Zhejiang, in mainland China.</s> <s>The buyer paid for a television device and became infrastructure.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>